1
00:00:00,383 --> 00:00:01,353
(Penny:)Let's just
take the test.

2
00:00:01,351 --> 00:00:02,921
(Leonard:)No, no, no,
I don't want to.

3
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:04,519
(Penny:)Oh, well, 'cause you
know we're gonna do bad.

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,990
(Leonard:)Because it doesn't matter.

5
00:00:05,989 --> 00:00:08,759
(Sheldon:)I don't care
if we're a ten or a two.

6
00:00:08,758 --> 00:00:12,028
(Sheldon:)Or a one.
A one is possible.

7
00:00:12,028 --> 00:00:14,658
(Leonard:)Marriage is scary.

8
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:16,234
(Leonard:)You're scared, I'm scared.

9
00:00:16,232 --> 00:00:18,762
(Leonard:)But it doesn't make me
not want to do it.

10
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,868
It-it just...

11
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:24,140
(Leonard:)makes me want to hold your hand
and do it with you.

12
00:00:25,608 --> 00:00:27,438
(Howard:)Leonard...

13
00:00:29,379 --> 00:00:32,879
(Amy:)It would make me so happy
if you said things like that.

14
00:00:32,882 --> 00:00:34,582
(Sheldon:)We got an
eight-point-two.

15
00:00:34,584 --> 00:00:36,654
(Sheldon:)Trust me, you're happy.

16
00:00:45,728 --> 00:00:49,198
Mm! I love how they put
a waterfall at center field.

17
00:00:49,198 --> 00:00:52,038
(Raj:)It really ties
the whole stadium together.

18
00:00:52,035 --> 00:00:56,025
(Penny:)Look at you, talking sports.

